  "Question": "The data 1, 2, 3, 4 are arranged in ascending order, and \\(n=4\\). Find the 50th percentile. Rule: \\(i=n\\times 50\\%\\); when \\(i\\) is an integer, take the mean of the values at positions \\(i\\) and \\(i+1\\).",
